<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Food Directories — Woodlands</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Expanded:wght@700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#12161d; --panel:#1c232d; --amber:#f5a623; --paper:#eceef2; --slate:#8792a3; --divider:#2b3340;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; min-height:100vh;
    background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 15% -10%, #1a2130 0%, transparent 60%), var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper); font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:640px; width:100%;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--amber); margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Archivo Expanded',sans-serif; font-weight:800;
    font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px); line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 14px;
  }
  p.sub{color:var(--slate); font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; max-width:480px; margin:0 0 32px;}
  .links{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;}
  a.card{
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px;
    background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--divider); border-radius:10px;
    padding:18px 20px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--paper);
    transition:transform .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  a.card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:var(--amber);}
  a.card .name{font-family:'Archivo Expanded',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:17px;}
  a.card .desc{font-size:13px; color:var(--slate);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Food Directories</div>
    <h1>Where to eat, sorted.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Two directory prototypes — mall-directory style for Causeway Point, and a neighbourhood guide for Woodlands 738094. Both come with search, filters, and a spin-the-wheel picker.</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="card" href="/causeway-point.html">
        <span class="name">Causeway Point →</span>
        <span class="desc">Floor-by-floor mall directory · 14 eateries · split-flap unit tags</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/woodlands-738094.html">
        <span class="name">Woodlands 738094 →</span>
        <span class="desc">Neighbourhood eateries near Woodlands Drive 72 · sorted by distance</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
